e_MDF_Activity_Number__c}</font><br><span class="rally-rte-class-0957adabf197cd" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">Activity type:&nbsp;{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Activity_Types__c}</span><span class="rally-rte-class-032b8c174a2432" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></span><span class="rally-rte-class-0957adabf197cd" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">Countries/locations:&nbsp;{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Country__c}</span><span class="rally-rte-class-032b8c174a2432" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">Status History:&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Fund_Request_Status__c}</span></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0d5bbfa3654181" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0d5bbfa3654181" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p></blockquote><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><p class="MsoPlainText" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">{!PartnerFundRequest.CreatedBy}<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;has requested your approval for the following item: <a href="{!ApprovalRequest.Internal_URL}">Click here</a></font></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Please click this link to approve or reject this record.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-070d6a52579c5f" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-070d6a52579c5f" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Thank you,</font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0d5bbfa3654181" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="rally-rte-class-08d03686a85553" style=""><span class="rally-rte-c